Key structural changes:
- [AVLTree.java](/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/044_avl_tree_insertion/AVLTree.java:5) is now a generic `AVLTree<T>` instead of a hard-coded integer demo.
